                    <li>Created Automate Address Domicile Prediction and Correction, an in-house program and algorithm using pattern matching technique and dictionary, solving and correcting valid but incorrect domicile name aliases. The accuracy results for correcting city domicile name aliases 79,1% and for district 97,6%.</li>
                    <li>Created Personal Identifiable Information (PII) Scanner, in-house algorithm, model, and program to scan, profile, tag PII from database tables. Outperforms Google Sensitive Data Protection for Indonesian PII by 40%, improving from 35-50% to 75-91%.</li>
                    <li><strong>Skills:</strong> Python, SQL, Machine Learning, Natural Language Processing, Data Science and Analytics, JupyterLab, BigQuery, Docker, Looker Studio, Airflow, Streamlit</li>
